## Key Features

| Component | Capabilities |
|-----------|--------------|
| **Vec3/Vec4** | SIMD-friendly alignment, all arithmetic, projection, reflection, refraction, slerp/nlerp |
| **Mat4** | Column-major, full TRS decomposition, stable Gauss-Jordan inverse, perspective/ortho/look_at |
| **Quat** | Hamilton product, axis-angle/Euler/matrix conversion, slerp/nlerp, vector rotation |
| **Camera** | View/projection matrices, world↔screen/NDC, screen→ray casting |
| **Angles** | Pitch/Yaw/Roll with normalization, shortest-path difference, forward vector conversion |
| **Interpolation** | Exponential decay (frame-rate independent), critically-damped spring, smoothstep |

