### Legitimate Use Cases

This framework is designed for:
- **Performance overlays** (FPS, frametime, GPU stats)
- **Debugging visualizers** (physics bounds, AI paths, audio sources)
- **Accessibility tools** (screen readers, focus indicators)
- **Streaming overlays** (alerts, chat, donation trackers)
- **Development tools** (level editors, profiling visualizers)

